# Fields & Inputs
- All form fields MUST use `FieldShell` with a field variant.
- Do NOT render raw <input>, <select>, or <textarea> directly in pages.
- Validation, error text, helper text, and icons must be handled by FieldShell.

# Modals & Popovers
- All modals MUST use `ModalTemplate`.


# Refactoring Rule (CRUNCH SAFE)
- Do NOT refactor backend contracts or handler signatures.


# General
- Prefer extracting reusable logic into hooks instead of duplicating behavior.
- If a required template does not exist, create it before implementing the feature.